     "titulo": "Clothes as the object",
     "texto": [
      "With **kupuję** («I buy»), the clothing noun takes the accusative.",
      "Many feminine nouns change **-a** to **-ę**: **kurtka → kurtkę**, **koszula → koszulę**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
